  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya, Malawi, South Africa, Uganda. The project works to improve the lives of their beneficiaries - slum dwellers - by increasing their access to secure tenure and basic health and social services, while simultaneously working to reduce vulnerability in the face of climate change, and the adverse effects this has on those living in socio-economically marginalised, high density communities.</narrative>
  </description>
